      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is even more pressing, now that the current Open Beta Nameplate redesign completely obliterates the amount of space for Pronouns.\n\nWhich is what I currently use to display different names as it always shows vs putting it within the Status.\n\nVRChat already keeps a history of pronouns used anyways…",
